nNotDelete`) on VM `FatehAli` and Resource Group `FATEHALI_GROUP` via Azure CLI:\n     `az lock create --name PreventVMDeletion --lock-type CanNotDelete --resource-group FATEHALI_GROUP --resource-name FatehAli --resource-type Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines`.\n6. **Deploy Continuous 6-Hour Adversarial Test Suite (Point 40):**\n   - Create an exhaustive automated test harness running hundreds of deletion vectors (direct rm, symlink bypass, python unlink, find delete, git clean, truncate, rename overwrite, sudo escalation attempt).\n   - Require 100% DENIED proof for every test before issuing the final `DELETE-PROOF = PASS` certification.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Zero Deletion:** Never execute a raw deletion. All requested deletions must be converted to an Archive operation in `GLOBAL-ARCHIVE`.\n- **Communication Directives:** Address user as **\"ইরাক ভাইয়া\"**, pure Bengal